        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana S41/4058U,  4\" x 4-1/4\" x 5/8\" Radius Leaf x Square Corner Leaf Fiberglass Door Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSold and priced as a pair, these 4\" security door hinges are made out of steel. They have a 5/8\" radius on one leaf and a square corner on the other. For use on Jeld-Wen doors and fiber glass doors that open outward where the hinge pins are outside the door. These extra <b>security door hinges</b> have locking tabs that join the 2 hinge leaves together when door is closed. This holds a closed door in place even if the door hinges are tampered with (if hinge pins are removed or cut).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackage includes a pair of hinges (2). Utilizes zig-zag screw hole pattern for use with wood or metal doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-S41-4058-specifications.gif?v=1704354605\" width=\"569\" height=\"256\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana S41/4058U Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 4 x 4-1/4 Fiber Glass Door Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Solid Steel</li>\r\n<li>Height: 4-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: 5/8\" Radius Leaf</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square Leaf</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.092\" (Residential)</li>\r\n<li>Removable Pin</li>\r\n<li>Zig-Zag Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Pin: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #9 x 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Security Tabs: Lock Tab to Join Hinge Leaves</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Yellow Zinc Plated</b></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-S41-4058U-specifications.pdf?v=1704262339\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana S41/4058U Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold in Pairs (2 Hinges)</b>\r\n</p>",
